OL,3,GNEWSABoston town centre revamp to be
OL,4,Arevealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new look for a formerly derelict site
OL,7,Fin Boston is to be unveiled soon.
OL,9,FThe regeneration of the town centre's
OL,10,FRosegarth Square started in January
OL,11,Flast year.
OL,13,FAn opening event will be held by Boston
OL,14,FBorough Council next month, the local
OL,15,Fauthority said.
OL,17,FThe area between the River Witham and
OL,18,Fthe bus station has been turned into a
OL,19,Fpublic park and it will include art,
OL,20,Fhousing and shops.
